            <ArticleTitle>The AngioGuard: a simplified snare?</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>153-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We describe a case of successful retrieval of a lost intracoronary stent using the ANGIOGUARD XP emboli retraction guidewire system (Cordis Corporation) as a safe and innovative method for management of this critical issue in an 80-year old male patient.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
